    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d566">

                <pb facs="0664" n="596" xml:id="pg596"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72/3314½</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1917-02-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 7, 1917</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Saw the Cuban Minister and advised him that it would be unwise for Cuba to break
                    off diplomatic relations with Germany. He said that he would so advise his
                    Govt</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
